5,0,1,talk,Misaki,,"Since we have no information yet, I suggest we observe each other's behavior. Let's keep the conversation open and see how everyone reacts.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree. I'll just listen for now. I'm not very good at this, but I'll try my best.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,A sensible start. Observation is the only logical path today. I'm interested to see who tries to steer the conversation too early.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I concur. We should prioritize reason over intuition. I will be analyzing the patterns of our discourse to identify any inconsistencies.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,It's nice to meet you all. Let's try to be kind to one another while we figure this out. I'm looking forward to our talk.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Midori, your kindness is appreciated, but we must remember the goal. Does anyone have a specific strategy for identifying the werewolf?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,pass,Daisuke,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,I'll be looking for contradictions. The werewolf and the possessed often overcompensate by trying to appear too helpful or too logical.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, that is a valid point. I will be watching for those who mirror others' opinions too closely to blend in.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,"I believe that by listening sincerely, the truth will reveal itself. But I will stay vigilant as Asuka suggested.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Daisuke, you're very quiet. Are you feeling nervous, or are you just observing?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'm just... a bit overwhelmed. I don't want to say the wrong thing and make people suspect me.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"Nervousness is a natural reaction, but it can also be a mask. We should keep an eye on everyone's emotional baseline.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Indeed. However, we must not mistake introversion for guilt. Let us focus on the information we gather tomorrow.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,"Poor Daisuke. Please don't worry too much. We are all in this together, and we'll find the truth together.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Misaki,,I think we've established our general approach. Let's conclude for today and wait for the Seer's first result.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,Okay. I'll try to be more confident tomorrow.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Asuka,,Agreed. I shall be analyzing today's interactions tonight.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,I am satisfied with this initial phase. I shall retire now.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Ryuji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Midori,,I wish everyone a peaceful night. See you all tomorrow.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
