36,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"Good morning. The Seer now has information. If anyone is willing to share their findings or has noticed something suspicious, please speak.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Good morning... I hope the Seer found something that helps us.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I am the Seer. I divined Ryuji last night, and he is the werewolf.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"That is a bold claim. Asuka, you've revealed yourself immediately. This could be a tactic by the werewolf to frame me and gain trust.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Oh my! Such a shocking start! Asuka, are you absolutely sure? It's so sad if Ryuji is the one.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Asuka, revealing yourself on Day 1 is risky. Why choose to do it so early?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,If Asuka is telling the truth... then we found him already? That seems too fast.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"It is the most logical move. If the werewolf is identified immediately, the village wins before more people are killed.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Or, the werewolf is pretending to be the Seer to eliminate a reliable villager. I am a human. Asuka is lying.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Midori,,"It's so confusing. I want to believe Asuka, but Ryuji seems so calm and serious.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Ryuji, if you are human, how do you explain Asuka's specific claim?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I don't know. I'm scared to vote the wrong person.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Asuka,,Ryuji's defense is generic. He is simply denying the claim without providing any counter-evidence.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"The evidence is that I have no reason to lie, whereas a werewolf has every reason to fake a divination.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Asuka, is there any other information you can give us to prove you are the Seer?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Misaki,,The Seer cannot prove their identity other than through their divinations. We must decide if we trust Asuka or Ryuji.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I think... I'll trust Asuka. She seemed very serious.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I have provided the truth. The choice is now yours.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I maintain my innocence. Voting me out is a mistake that will benefit the real wolf.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Midori,,I'll go with the majority. It's a very difficult choice.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
